  "negative_note": "`no_swing: true` marks a clip that contains no swing at all. A detector that reports phases here is not merely imprecise, it is inventing a swing -- which is the P1.1 defect: the app produced a full fault report with drills for a video of nothing.",
  "practice_note": "`practice_swings_s` lists excursions that are real swings but NOT the one the golfer wanted a report on. They are the hardest distractor there is: they happen inside the stance, they have the correct shape, and no amount of signal cleaning can tell them from the real swing. Only something that knows which one the golfer meant can."
